# Publishing (`npx preview publish`). Copy to .env.local, which is gitignored, and uncomment.
# Expo loads .env.local for a release bundle, and publish reads PREVIEW_S3_* from the same files.
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are built into the app, so the write key stays out of it. Keep the
# write key out of a committed .env. Real environment variables (CI secrets) win over this file.

# Required: <endpoint>/<bucket>[/<folder>], and the write key. Local MinIO test values:
# PREVIEW_S3_URL=http://localhost:9000/previews-public
# PREVIEW_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=preview-admin
# PREVIEW_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=preview-admin-secret

# The private bucket instead (same write key):
# PREVIEW_S3_URL=http://localhost:9000/previews-private

# Optional signing region, default us-east-1 (MinIO and R2 accept it); change it for an AWS bucket in another region.
# PREVIEW_S3_REGION=us-east-1
